# Deploy backups. The deployment rsyncs into an unpacked copy of this directory
# and keeps a `<name>.predeploy-<timestamp>` alongside the original, which lands
# in the build context. For a backup of `src/` that means TypeScript sees the
# same sources twice, the inferred rootDir widens from `src` to the project
# root, and the build silently emits `dist/src/main.js` — the image builds fine
# and then crash-loops on `Cannot find module '/app/dist/main'`.
*.predeploy-*
*.log
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
